{"parse": {"title": "睡前故事-03", "pageid": 65501, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9D%A1%E5%89%8D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-02\" title=\"睡前故事-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">睡前故事-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9D%A1%E5%89%8D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-04\" title=\"睡前故事-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">睡前故事</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.91.87.E7.AF.AE.E6.9B.B2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"摇篮曲\">摇篮曲</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 摇篮曲</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>“在高高的枝梢上，风儿吹拂，摇篮轻轻晃……”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_xinzangfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>“树枝折断后，摇篮落下……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>呀，你醒了，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>真抱歉，我没想到你会受到这样大的惊吓……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-309913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>咳咳、我……我没事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她挣扎着从侍应生的膝头爬起，将不知何时取下的耳机重新戴好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乡村音乐代替了轻柔的摇篮曲，也压下了她喉管里的瘙痒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>你什么时候醒的？这房间又是怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……你认识蓝帽朵儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>哎呀，哎呀，您一醒来就有成串的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我从没听过您说的名字，即使它听上去相当可爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>至于房间，在您的身体恢复前，都可以留在这间房里。它很安全，也很安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>可惜没有一张书桌——我们是家小旅馆，条件有限，还请您原谅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>也请您原谅我的措辞……我想这是非法监禁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您虚弱得才刚刚恢复一点精神，又在我的照顾下做了个美梦，为何还要责怪我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她习惯性地低下头，理了理裙摆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>那是个噩梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>那您应当没能睡好。这就更该安心休息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>真羡慕你们这些活泼的孩子……我从不做梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……那不是您的梦吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生并没有关注这句几近喃喃自语的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>好了，好了。我不能总在这儿同您聊天，还有许多事等着我去办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我还得回公路上等待客人，也得添些蔬菜呀，面包呀……这些东西都消耗得很快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>稍后我也会为您送一份餐点的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>请稍等。我还有最后一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羊羔指向房间中央的婴儿床。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>您怀里的孩子不在这儿，这间房也实在不像一间儿童房。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>襁褓中真的有您的孩子吗？还是一副骨架，一个小小的幽灵？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我刚到这儿的时候，曾有人向我提起旅馆失踪案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>——您的“孩子”，失踪的旅客，奇怪的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有问出的是，下一个是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您呀。我真的很喜欢您——其他许多人甚至不敢当面问起这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生的脸颊又泛起了红晕。这并未替她彰显生命力，而是越发衬托出了她的纤细和单薄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像一把随时会折断的银餐刀，哪儿有什么威胁呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>您使我伤心了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>但即使如此，我还是会回答您。不能每当孩子们犯错，就施加惩罚……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>因为他们迟早会习惯的。他们会不再为此害怕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>襁褓中是我最心爱的一个孩子，也最幼小，很不愿我把注意力放到别的地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>我们说了太多话，它不想见到您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咔哒。侍应生轻巧地后退，带上了房门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>采访不会总如预料中顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羊羔沿着墙壁转了一圈，试图找到那只曾提供过帮助的小蜘蛛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这需要足够的耐心和良好的视力。好在她也没有别的事可做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一番徒劳的尝试之后，她在地板上坐下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-309901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>先把已知信息整理出来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>蓝手帕和蓝帽朵儿。她们是同一个人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>目前的答案倾向于“不是”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>但我个人对此持保留意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>旅馆的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻过一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我的神秘术，需要接触正在做梦的个体才生效。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>我只接触了蓝手帕，还有房间的地板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>但她否认了。所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-309812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>噢，好孩子。你找到答案了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>旅馆里或许发生过谋杀案，意外事故……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-309911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">数羊羔：</div><div>房间里徘徊着我看不到的幽灵，我进入的是它们的梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-309813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-309813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-309813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>唉。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanzoulang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>侍应生失望地叹了口气，将眼睛从锁孔前挪开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>真是个笨拙的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛为了应和她的话，走廊上其他的房门齐齐开合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>安静。别吵着了其他客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她身旁的房门悄悄敞开了一条缝，一只倒霉的蜘蛛不慎跌落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>没关系，留几只蜘蛛给那孩子作伴吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-309801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝手帕：</div><div>这次你的表现还不错，我会带上你一块儿出门的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊尽头并未亮灯，侍应生径直走入那片黑暗。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "睡前故事-03"}}